# megadj environment — copy to .env (or export in your shell profile).
# Every key has a sane default; all of them are OPTIONAL. `megadj doctor`
# reports which ones matter for the features you use.

# ---- archive (GetDat) ----
# Where downloaded audio lands.
# MEGADJ_MUSIC_DIR=~/Music/DJ-Imports
# The archive's memory (SQLite).
# MEGADJ_DB=~/.local/state/megadj/archive.db
# Browser yt-dlp reads cookies from ("chrome" | "firefox" | "brave" | ...).
# Empty disables cookie use entirely.
# MEGADJ_COOKIES=chrome
# Netscape cookie jar for headless runs (scripts/export-cookies.sh writes
# one) — overrides MEGADJ_COOKIES when set.
# MEGADJ_COOKIES_FILE=

# ---- AI (FullTags) ----
# AI genre/year fallback + `megadj artwork`. Get one at openrouter.ai.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# ES module path exporting an ImageClient, for AI-generated covers.
# Unset = AI covers fail loudly (the queue is preserved).
# IMAGE_MAKER_CLIENT=
# Max AI covers per `megadj artwork` pass.
# MEGADJ_ART_MAX=20
# Where artwork misses are queued for AI covers.
# MEGADJ_ART_QUEUE=~/.local/state/megadj/artwork-queue.jsonl
# Same queue, FullTags-side name (`megadj artwork` consumes both).
# FULLTAGS_ARTWORK_QUEUE=~/.local/state/megadj/artwork-queue.jsonl

# ---- CrateDeck ----
# Dashboard state (DB, snapshots, images).
# CRATEDECK_DATA=~/.local/state/cratedeck
# Dashboard port (`bun run deck`).
# CRATEDECK_PORT=7742
# Extra volumes to watch beyond /Volumes (colon-separated).
# CRATEDECK_VOLUMES=
# Drive-photo search provider: "brave" or "exa".
# CRATEDECK_IMAGE_PROVIDER=brave
# API key for the image provider (optional).
# CRATEDECK_IMAGE_KEY=

# ---- USB sync one-shot (scripts/sync-usb.sh) ----
# Drive names — override per invocation or in your shell; independent of
# cratedeck/config.toml (which `megadj init` writes from mounted volumes).
# USB_SYNC_MASTER=DJMASTER
# USB_SYNC_MIRROR=DJMIRROR
